<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 500 bln yen of 1.7 pct 6-year JGBs.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 500 bln yen of 1.7 pct 6-year JGBs.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance offered 500 billion yen of 1.7 pct six-year Japanese government bonds (JGBs) through a price competitive auction on Friday.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be January 31 and maturity date January 20, 2003.</p>
</text>
